WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:03.940
Take Nozomi and get out of here.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.740
<i>Systema? The martial arts used
by Russian special forces?</i>

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.200
Zloy dukh Systema.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:21.380
We need to work hard enough
to justify our salaries.

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.110
Let's play, Magical Girl.

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:28.760
<i>This might not be easy.</i>

00:02:09.480 --> 00:02:10.770
Iizuka-san...

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.410
<i>Yeah, I can hear you.</i>

00:02:12.810 --> 00:02:14.400
I've recovered the hostage.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.110
She's stable.

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:18.570
Rapture is in combat with the terrorists.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.120
<i>I've got an ambulance
on standby, I'm sending it over.</i>

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.280
<i>Put the hostage aboard.</i>

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.270
Roger.

00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:33.460
What sound does a Magical Girl make
when you cut off her limb, I wonder?

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:43.470
<b>A Very Realistic Way of Dealing with a Problem</b>

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:57.280
<i>They've applied a military two-man
cell technique to magical combat.</i>

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:00.300
<i>I need to do something about that spirit.</i>

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.820
This is M Squad.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:05.220
We have the hostage.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:08.280
We will now support the Magical Girls.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:11.650
<i>A terrorist with a bomb
is in a standoff in Ookubo,</i>

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:13.500
<i>and the riot police have him surrounded.</i>

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.120
<i>That's what we're telling the press.</i>

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.330
Thanks,

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:19.170
<i>Commissioner Miura.</i>

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.920
<i>And Inspector Makino,</i>

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.640
<i>your daughter is safe.</i>

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.580
According to our interrogations
of Kim Kanth,

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:35.530
they have an illegally-created
Magical Girl backing them,

00:03:35.620 --> 00:03:37.960
<i>as well as magical mercenaries.</i>

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.870
I see.

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:41.320
But...

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:43.100
<i>This was expected.</i>

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.990
M Squad's troops are elite,

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.490
but they're still human, right?

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:48.780
How will you fight?

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:51.750
Don't worry.

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:57.110
My squad has very realistic
tactics for dealing with Magical Girls.

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:15.000
<i>I need to go save Asuka-san.</i>

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:22.530
You're gonna pay for what
you did back there.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:40.170
Magical Girl Barber Scissors Abby.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:43.060
M-Magical Girl?

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:48.210
I'll cut you to pieces with
my magical scissors.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:28.660
Magical Calorie Roll-Up!

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.060
Rip them apart,

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.680
Rapture Talon!

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.400
Rusalka!

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.530
Magical Girl Trivia!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:45.930
Rapture Talon:

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:49.350
the Magical Karambit,
but magically grown to a huge size!

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.110
It uses up a lot of magical energy,

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.350
but it hits hard, chu!

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:00.840
<i>Using that big move
has drained my magic, but...</i>

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:04.780
In a one-on-one fight,

00:06:04.780 --> 00:06:07.300
you're no match for me.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.340
Thanks to you,

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.220
I was able to get my sense
for magical combat back.

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.000
Sacchuu!

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:23.480
Leave it to me, chu!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.460
Go!

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:28.030
War Nurse!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:31.170
I want to kill you.

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:33.760
I really want to kill you, but...

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:38.700
The queen's orders must be followed!

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:40.310
<i>The queen...</i>

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:42.170
<i>Her commander?</i>

00:06:42.170 --> 00:06:44.830
I'll beat you half to death
and then kidnap you.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:47.620
I'll let you off easy today.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.730
<i>Two Halloween-classes?</i>

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.690
<i>No, these are also enhanced!</i>

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.290
Gotcha!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:56.440
<i>Gobu!</i>

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:11.620
I see.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:14.810
She's just as strong, huh?

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.620
That's my Asuka!

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:21.780
That concludes my report, Your Majesty.

00:08:21.780 --> 00:08:25.060
Why are you sneaking around, chu?!

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:30.750
Who is your leader, this "queen," chu?

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:33.020
I ain't tellin' you, gobu!

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:34.860
Gobu! Gobu!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:35.630
Well,

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.880
compared to the queen,
you guys ain't nothing but tras—

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:39.620
<b>Gobu</b>!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.100
Spirit Punch!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.310
Sacchuu got 'im, chu!

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.310
Why try to kill him?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.780
Seal his magic and capture
him while he's still breathing.

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:53.840
Right away, chu.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.170
Iizuka-san,

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:57.080
the magical mercenaries are down,

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:58.760
and the enemy fairy has been captured.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:00.260
Well done.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:04.180
Tell Sacchuu to bring it here.

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.700
<i>Is Nozomi okay?</i>

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:06.580
Yeah.

00:09:07.250 --> 00:09:10.940
But War Nurse is in combat with the enemy.

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:13.410
<i>They followed her.</i>

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:15.660
<i>She's in combat to your southwest.</i>

00:09:15.770 --> 00:09:16.690
Roger!

00:09:20.970 --> 00:09:23.620
Look at you. You're a mess.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.330
Everybody talks about the Magical Five,

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.490
but you're nothing.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:31.320
I...

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:33.080
I don't like that.

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.620
That Magical Five thing.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.640
There were eleven of us!

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.810
We five were just the only survivors.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:50.480
It's the six who died who should be legends!

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:55.150
God <i>damn</i>, you're gloomy!

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.780
Well, you hung in there.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:18.680
I guess I'll just take off below
the knees, so you can't run.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:30.570
Chief,

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.310
our firing tests were accurate.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:36.720
A bullet with an Orichalcum core can 
penetrate a Halloween-class's magic shield.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.170
It was extremely effective.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:39.450
<i>Well done.</i>

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.160
M Squad, begin the attack!

00:10:43.490 --> 00:10:44.950
<i>Ise, take out the Disas beast.</i>

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:48.910
<i>Kaede, use APHE rounds to
deal with the enemy Magical Girl.</i>

00:11:01.140 --> 00:11:02.760
Are you okay?

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:05.950
You came for me, didn't you?

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:09.230
It's time to show you the
results of our training.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.220
One Halloween-Class down.

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:17.640
We are currently engaged
with the enemy Magical Girl.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.560
The Magical Girl

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:22.530
seems capable of deploying a magical shield
more powerful than a Halloween-class's.

00:11:22.690 --> 00:11:24.050
It's fine.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:28.160
All you have to do is keep her where she is.

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.490
Roger.

00:11:30.300 --> 00:11:32.540
I'll use special incendiary
ammo to delay her.

00:11:35.580 --> 00:11:40.680
Who the fuck do you maggots think you are?

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.080
M Squad's done all we can ask of them.

00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:48.140
The most effective way to deal
with a Magical Girl...

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.210
As of now,

00:11:50.210 --> 00:11:52.160
it's simply to send another
Magical Girl at them.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:58.480
You seemed so happy when
you cut the hostage's arm off.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:03.320
I'm surprised to see so much pain
on your face after I cut off your fingers.

00:12:03.430 --> 00:12:06.060
Rapture, you bitch!

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.330
When there are more Magical Girls,

00:12:09.980 --> 00:12:12.290
it means there's more trash like you!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.810
Wh-What is this?

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:21.460
A magical cube?

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:23.650
The source of the magic is...

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:25.320
Over there!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:33.310
A new Magical Girl has appeared!

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:36.780
<i>M Squad has been
cut off by a magical barrier!</i>

00:12:44.270 --> 00:12:46.140
I can't make it with the magic I've got now.

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:51.250
My queen...

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:57.040
<i>I know her!</i>

00:12:58.130 --> 00:12:59.300
<i>Who is she?</i>

00:12:59.300 --> 00:13:00.460
<i>Where have I seen her?</i>

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.970
The magical signal has disappeared.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.810
Looks like we've defeated the enemy.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.250
We didn't defeat them.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:18.120
They just left.

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:21.400
The hostage was saved,

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:24.320
and two Halloween-classes were defeated.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:26.610
This is a big success.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.250
Well, maybe not a big one,

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:30.040
but it's enough.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.830
<i>Why did they run?</i>

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.540
<i>If they had fought, we would've...</i>

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.800
Rapture...

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:02.010
War Nurse...

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.530
Makino Akinori.

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.040
As Nozomi's father,

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:10.650
let me thank you.

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:12.510
How is she doing?

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:17.070
Thanks to War Nurse's skilled hands,

00:14:17.070 --> 00:14:19.240
her external wounds have healed.

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:20.580
External wounds?

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:21.340
Yeah.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.840
The mental damage...

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:27.710
Just seeing a small pair
of scissors is enough to...

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:32.480
Nozomi, I'm sorry.

00:14:32.480 --> 00:14:34.510
Was I too loud?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.550
Please, no more!

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:48.920
Don't hurt me with magic!

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:48.910
Nozomi!

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:51.870
I'll do anything! Please!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:53.830
They're not the enemy!

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:56.220
They saved you!

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:57.140
Why?

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:58.950
Why won't you leave?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:01.920
I don't want to even see a Magical Girl!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.020
She's been like this ever since then.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:17.550
She might struggle with
PTSD for the rest of her life.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:25.800
My magic can heal her.

00:15:26.620 --> 00:15:27.940
Really?

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:33.720
It will involve removing all her
memories of the past week, though.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:37.630
Let's eat lunch together.

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.950
You know, you want to give your
all at the thing you're good at, right?

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:42.040
You need to have
fun with your life right now!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.390
So let's do this again!

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:49.640
But if you think it will save her...

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:50.670
Wait.

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:52.740
Rapture?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.420
No, it's nothing.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.030
War Nurse...

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:01.850
Will there be any after-effects?

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.140
No.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:08.590
But if any more time passes, and the trauma
affixes itself to her nervous system...

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:10.060
I won't be able to do anything.

00:16:14.490 --> 00:16:19.050
If it will make things 
easier for my daughter...

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:21.530
Please.

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.010
All right.

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:24.690
That's your cue.

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:25.830
Sacchuu!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:29.810
I will begin the memory-erasing procedure.

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:30.940
Sacchuu,

00:16:30.940 --> 00:16:33.470
your job will be to project the contents

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:35.530
of her brain environment in real
time and monitor her condition.

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:36.520
Roger.

00:16:43.480 --> 00:16:47.040
This is an autonomous needle
for use in delicate operations.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.840
This procedure is to erase
short-term memories,

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:53.110
so the needle will extend
into her hippocampus.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:56.520
In order to ensure that she doesn't
experience any flashbacks,

00:16:56.520 --> 00:17:00.480
we will isolate the ganglions
connected to episodic memory

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:02.670
via the hippocampus.

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:06.480
I'm injecting magically-charged
microparticles into the hippocampus.

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.560
It's done.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:20.520
When she wakes up,

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:23.020
she'll be the daughter you once knew.

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.760
I'm so sorry.

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:33.890
Asuka-san, um...

00:17:33.890 --> 00:17:37.240
You may laugh if I say this, but...

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:40.030
When I was a kid,

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.440
my dream was to be a Magical Girl.

00:17:43.320 --> 00:17:48.000
A Magical Girl who used magic to defeat
the bad guys and save everybody.

00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:51.180
But in reality,

00:17:51.180 --> 00:17:54.860
fighting the enemy isn't that simple.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:18:00.510
I've let many of my comrades
die in the war three years ago.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:02.810
And this time,

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:04.640
what happened to Nozomi...

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:07.820
I knew it, I just didn't want to admit it.

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:12.560
I can't protect anything.

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:15.280
Don't say that, please.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.560
Kurumi...

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:18.510
If it weren't for you,

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:21.040
both Nozomi-san
and I would've been killed.

00:18:21.210 --> 00:18:23.260
You saved us!

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.000
Magical Girl Rapture Asuka saved us!

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:28.420
So...

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:31.120
I want you to keep your head up and fight,

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:33.730
and know that the path
you chose was the right one.

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:36.210
But I can't.

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:36.960
You can!

00:18:38.650 --> 00:18:43.510
I became a Magical Girl
because I wanted to be like you.

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.430
Thank you, Kurumi.

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:58.860
Did you do the procedure
on Makino Nozomi?

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.130
It was successful.

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:02.320
I see.

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:11.750
It hurts to have someone
you know get caught up in this.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:15.190
To tell the truth,

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:18.680
I'd love it if we could solve this
with just professional soldiers.

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:23.580
But the truth of the matter is, right now,

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:26.440
the only way to win a magical
fight is to use Magical Girls.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.080
It's pathetic.

00:19:30.990 --> 00:19:32.160
Iizuka-san...

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:37.150
You have things only you can do.

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:38.840
Of course,

00:19:38.840 --> 00:19:40.610
we Magical Girls do, too.

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:45.040
I'll join your spec-ops team.

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:50.530
The Magical Girl Operations
Development Unit,

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:51.720
M Squad.

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.210
Asuka-san!

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:16.270
A Magical Girl who saves everyone, huh?

00:21:50.490 --> 00:21:52.990
<b>JGSDF Narashino Garrison</b>

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:52.990
The hostage,

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.460
Makino Nozomi

00:21:54.460 --> 00:21:57.850
has had both her face and
identity identified by the terrorists.

00:21:57.850 --> 00:22:00.880
There's a chance they'll
go after her again.

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:04.230
In light of the psychological stress
that would place on Rapture,

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:06.750
I believe Makino Nozomi should

00:22:06.750 --> 00:22:10.130
be given a new identity
and sent to a faraway school.

00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:13.140
Public Safety Foreign Affairs
 thinks differently.

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:16.980
If they continue to go after Makino Nozomi,

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:20.770
Foreign Affairs wants
to use her as bait for a trap.

00:22:21.680 --> 00:22:24.300
She's bait, huh?

00:22:24.300 --> 00:22:26.660
To Foreign Affairs, yes.

00:22:28.130 --> 00:22:33.260
Two Magical Girls go to that school.

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:36.410
Don't you think that's safer than
trying to hide her somewhere?

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:40.030
Let's give them what they want.

00:22:42.170 --> 00:22:45.540
Anyway, well done on the Rapture matter.

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:49.220
Now the M Squad plan can really begin.

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:51.930
Yes.

00:22:55.950 --> 00:22:57.510
Morning, Asuka!

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:00.040
Hey. Morning, Nozomi.

00:23:01.720 --> 00:23:04.770
My Asuka's looking as pretty
as ever this morning!

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:07.780
Um...

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:10.530
Are you feeling okay?

00:23:10.780 --> 00:23:11.940
Of course!

00:23:11.940 --> 00:23:15.040
It's the first time this year
we're going to the pool!

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:24.290
Yeah, you're right.

00:23:41.170 --> 00:23:42.470
This is for the best.

00:23:43.170 --> 00:23:44.520
Asuka!

00:23:44.520 --> 00:23:45.690
There you are!

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:48.820
Hey, are you free this weekend?

00:23:49.310 --> 00:23:51.020
Let's go see this!

00:23:51.170 --> 00:23:54.530
<i>Cheerleader Samurai vs. Megaton Shark</i>!

00:23:56.380 --> 00:23:58.810
It's starting this Saturday.

00:23:59.610 --> 00:24:01.660
What's wrong, Asuka?

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:04.310
Nothing.

00:24:06.060 --> 00:24:09.220
I was looking forward to seeing it with you.

00:24:12.290 --> 00:24:14.740
A brief break after the battle!

00:24:14.740 --> 00:24:17.490
But when Magical Girl Just
Cause Mia comes to Japan,

00:24:17.490 --> 00:24:19.800
there's more trouble in store!

00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:21.550
Next time: "Wish Upon a Star."

00:24:20.100 --> 00:24:23.940
<b>Wish Upon a Star</b>

00:24:21.550 --> 00:24:24.020
I was born to provide combat support,

00:24:24.020 --> 00:24:26.630
so I have no dreams or 
wishes besides victory, chu!
